  m_Name: unit_810858
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Scorching Blade Roy
  unitId: 810858
  unitNumber: 8606
  description: "The commander of the 31st Division of the Demon Slayers, the Sun
    Cuore. When he was younger, Roy dreamed of being like a certain Summoner who
    had left their mark on the history of Akras Summoners' Hall, and thus worked
    hard to enter the Hall himself by the age of sixteen, growing closer to his goal.
    Honest and amiable by nature, on the day of his enlistment he was unexpectedly
    roped into one of Noel's crazy experiments. From that point on he was entrusted
    with task after task, proving his mettle as a Summoner by not only helping Noel
    with his research, but also rookies out on their first missions.Four years later,
    Seria, Grand Commander of the Demon Slayers, made Roy a Demon Slayer. She had
    shared many a mission with, and even brought him along with Noel to Extas when
    the world was first discovered. It was following this that Roy was entrusted
    with rookie Summoners, helping them with their training and development. Kind
    yet powerful, many came to hold him in high regard, unknowingly becoming an inspirational
    figure for others while simply following an inspiration of his own.When Roy turned
    thirty, his achievements were recognized by Akras Summoners' Hall, and he was
    assigned command over his own division within the Demon Slayers. He named it
    after the fairy that always follows him on his adventures\u2014Sun Cuore. Later
    on he would even come to instruct Sasha, daughter of Elder Summoner Lugina, who
    would become his disciple upon completing her training. While on orders from
    Elder Summoner Karl to investigate Grand Gaia, he meets a mysterious young warrior
    hailing from another world, and the two join forces to fight a new common enemy."
  summonDesc: When you start something, you gotta finish it.<br>Our battle will never
    truly be over until we help you achieve your goal!
  fusionDesc: Looks like I've gotten stronger thanks to you.<br>Sun Cuore gives her
    thanks too!<br>Oh what? You can't see her? Well, she can be kinda shy...
  evoDesc: If you wish for something hard enough, it will come true if it means others
    will be happy too.<br>Sun Cuore will help you with this, I'm sure.
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
